1013..1089 Comment "/// The left inverse\'s round trip through the forward map, at `y`: the right"
1090..1168 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip at `y` carried back along the left inverse, joined to"
1169..1245 Comment "/// the left inverse\'s round trip at `h(y)`, makes the two inverses agree at"
1246..1316 Comment "/// `y`; carried along the forward map, that agreement turns the right"
1317..1394 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip into the left one\'s. Each map is stated as `a => b`,"
1395..1450 Comment "/// which `Path.ap` reads as it reads `+U (a -> -F b)`."
